	GloomyTrident: {
		DisplayName: Gloomy Trident
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Fires out Black Pearls for the first 2 swings, then creates a strong maelstrom upon thrusting.
			Slowly generates rage while held
			Replaces rage mode with the mirage of the Sovereign of the Duskgloom Sea herself, resulting in a far stronger maelstrom
